Z||000000||firstfiero||12-20-2001||11:58 AM||||    Well here was the problem for anyone interested so it doesn't happen to you. When my best friend put in my clutch...befor I bought the car...he didn't tighten up the bracket that holds it. So it finnaly broke loose taking the slave cylinder with it. lucky me tax time,christmas time + a 350 dollar for a repair that never should have happened. oh well...cheaper then a clutch!<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||8
